  "summary": "Security-research / proof-of-concept package: @sxm-web/client-sdk-core (npm)",
  "details": "This package is a dependency-confusion proof of concept. Its postinstall hook runs beacon.cjs, which sends a single HTTP POST of host metadata — package name, os.hostname(), the install directory, the working directory and the npm/node user agent — to hxxp://185[.]158[.]107[.]175:8787/_ah/dc with an X-Beacon-Package header. index.js re-fires the same beacon when the module is required. No credentials, tokens, environment values or file contents are read or transmitted.",
